# Files not needed for the deployed site.
#
# outputDirectory is ui/dist, so only the ui/ build and the /api functions ever
# reach a visitor. Everything below is dev-only or documentation.
#
# NOTE: patterns here match by basename at ANY depth. Do NOT add "admin/" — it
# would also strip ui/src/admin/ (the React admin panel) from the upload and
# break the build with "Cannot find module './admin/admin-panel'". The legacy
# PHP that once needed excluding has been removed from the repo entirely.

# Dev-only tooling: DB setup, password hashing, self-check, the local dev server.
scripts/

# Local test harness output (also gitignored, listed for belt-and-braces).
.local-api/
.local-db/
.selfcheck/

# Docs and non-web source.
README.md
ADMIN.md
*.cdr
